WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.085 --> 00:00:06.628
Please,

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:07.963
stand up.

00:00:10.173 --> 00:00:11.758
If you're able.

00:00:12.551 --> 00:00:13.718
Thank you.

00:00:16.054 --> 00:00:19.432
I want you to feel like I felt,

00:00:19.432 --> 00:00:21.560
when I was getting sentenced.

00:00:21.601 --> 00:00:25.355
It's August 17, 2012.

00:00:26.356 --> 00:00:28.525
I’m handcuffed

00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:35.615
and standing for four long hours
while the judge is reading my sentence.

00:00:37.993 --> 00:00:40.370
You're in a small cage

00:00:40.412 --> 00:00:46.126
and you're surrounded
by 10 prison guards in balaclavas.

00:00:47.168 --> 00:00:52.799
There is also a guard dog
who is barking at you angrily

00:00:52.841 --> 00:00:56.344
because the dog is trained
to be suspicious

00:00:56.386 --> 00:00:59.723
towards people who smell like prison.

00:00:59.723 --> 00:01:03.143
Even a nice little doge is angry at me.

00:01:03.643 --> 00:01:06.479
I'm stripped down from my humanity.

00:01:06.521 --> 00:01:09.816
I'm reduced to being just a prisoner.

00:01:11.067 --> 00:01:14.988
I'm 22 and I smell like prison.

00:01:15.488 --> 00:01:19.492
The prosecutor asked
for three years in jail for me.

00:01:19.826 --> 00:01:24.039
My crime is considered to be severe,

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:28.418
and it means that the judge
can give me up to seven years in jail.

00:01:29.878 --> 00:01:34.674
And as I'm standing here
handcuffed behind the bars,

00:01:34.674 --> 00:01:36.384
I’m thinking to myself:

00:01:37.719 --> 00:01:41.348
Can one person change the world?

00:01:42.557 --> 00:01:44.351
Is it even worth trying?

00:01:44.392 --> 00:01:48.396
Or am I just setting myself
up for failure?

00:01:49.272 --> 00:01:52.692
Will I be able to achieve my dreams

00:01:52.734 --> 00:01:56.363
or I'm going to be inevitably
smashed by the system?

00:01:59.366 --> 00:02:03.745
I ran away from home
when I was 16 years old.

00:02:03.787 --> 00:02:08.750
I jumped on a plane,
went from Siberia to Moscow.

00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:10.919
I was 16 and I was a dreamer.

00:02:11.461 --> 00:02:15.006
And I knew that I want two things in life.

00:02:15.006 --> 00:02:19.511
I want to be able to dream wildly

00:02:19.511 --> 00:02:22.931
and to be able to make
my utopian dreams come true.

00:02:23.348 --> 00:02:26.810
For that, I knew I needed to be in Moscow.

00:02:27.811 --> 00:02:29.396
I was studying philosophy

00:02:29.437 --> 00:02:34.818
and I was stealing food
and clothes in order to survive.

00:02:36.277 --> 00:02:38.405
When I turned 22,

00:02:38.405 --> 00:02:43.410
I got arrested for resisting to one
of the most dangerous dictators

00:02:43.451 --> 00:02:44.953
on planet Earth.

00:02:46.162 --> 00:02:50.333
At the day of my arrest,
my daughter turned four.

00:02:51.543 --> 00:02:53.336
You can sit down if you want.

00:02:57.716 --> 00:02:59.968
What is my crime exactly?

00:03:00.802 --> 00:03:02.429
I sang a song.

00:03:03.221 --> 00:03:06.933
"Virgin Mary, please get rid of Putin."

00:03:07.976 --> 00:03:10.979
Me and four other members of Pussy Riot

00:03:10.979 --> 00:03:13.815
came to Cathedral of Christ the Saviour,

00:03:13.857 --> 00:03:16.693
and we preached to the people of Russia

00:03:16.693 --> 00:03:20.196
from the holy place that
for thousands of years

00:03:20.196 --> 00:03:23.992
was reserved only for the male preachers

00:03:23.992 --> 00:03:27.996
and, in particular, for the patriarch
of the Russian Orthodox Church,

00:03:27.996 --> 00:03:34.002
who today sends Russians
to kill and to die in Ukraine.

00:03:35.420 --> 00:03:40.800
We sang our song
on February 21 of 2012.

00:03:41.384 --> 00:03:44.304
We did it in response
to Putin's announcement

00:03:44.345 --> 00:03:48.224
that he wants to rule Russia
pretty much indefinitely.

00:03:49.476 --> 00:03:52.604
I dropped everything I was doing,

00:03:52.604 --> 00:03:55.690
and I promised to myself

00:03:55.732 --> 00:03:58.777
that I'm going to dedicate
my life to resistance.

00:04:00.069 --> 00:04:05.825
I felt deep inside me
that Putin equals death,

00:04:05.867 --> 00:04:07.535
medieval torture,

00:04:07.535 --> 00:04:10.246
knife in the back, stagnation,

00:04:10.246 --> 00:04:13.500
new Dark Ages for Russia.

00:04:15.335 --> 00:04:19.130
To resist, we used our loud voices,

00:04:19.172 --> 00:04:22.717
bright ski masks, dresses, courage,

00:04:22.717 --> 00:04:25.595
commitment and performance art.

00:04:26.429 --> 00:04:29.390
We would show up in public places,

00:04:29.432 --> 00:04:32.060
unannounced, guerrilla style.

00:04:32.101 --> 00:04:34.020
No permits at all.

00:04:34.771 --> 00:04:37.106
And perform, preach.

00:04:37.649 --> 00:04:43.905
We performed in government buildings,
squares, shopping malls,

00:04:43.947 --> 00:04:48.326
and we would get arrested
almost every single day,

00:04:48.326 --> 00:04:51.704
get out and go back to action.

00:04:52.372 --> 00:04:59.337
Our job was to show the people of Russia
that resisting is indeed an option.

00:05:02.048 --> 00:05:04.926
The supreme, sacred,

00:05:04.926 --> 00:05:07.637
holy rule in Putin's Russia

00:05:07.679 --> 00:05:09.430
is to remain afraid.

00:05:10.723 --> 00:05:12.725
We decided to break this rule.

00:05:13.893 --> 00:05:17.272
By breaking this rule,
we disrupted the game as such.

00:05:17.939 --> 00:05:21.693
We exposed it as a mere game.

00:05:22.735 --> 00:05:25.738
We said that the emperor is naked.

00:05:29.075 --> 00:05:32.662
Did we achieve what we wanted?

00:05:34.747 --> 00:05:37.000
As I'm standing behind
the bars, handcuffed,

00:05:37.041 --> 00:05:38.960
I'm asking myself this question.

00:05:39.002 --> 00:05:41.087
Yes and no.

00:05:42.547 --> 00:05:46.134
As I said in my closing statement,

00:05:46.175 --> 00:05:48.678
we are behind the prison bars,

00:05:48.678 --> 00:05:52.348
but we are freer than people
who are prosecuting us

00:05:52.348 --> 00:05:54.559
because we can say whatever we want to say

00:05:54.601 --> 00:05:56.019
and they can say only things

00:05:56.060 --> 00:05:59.689
that the government censorship
allows them to say.

00:06:01.149 --> 00:06:03.943
Despite of the global movement
in support of Pussy Riot,

00:06:03.943 --> 00:06:08.114
we got convicted to two years in jail.

00:06:10.283 --> 00:06:12.035
The hell was in front of me.

00:06:13.578 --> 00:06:19.751
I was forced to sew
police and military uniforms

00:06:19.792 --> 00:06:22.795
and I was getting injured
while I was doing it.

00:06:23.546 --> 00:06:27.175
But even in the darkest moments,

00:06:27.216 --> 00:06:29.510
I knew that our fight is not over.

00:06:35.975 --> 00:06:38.144
Two years later,

00:06:38.186 --> 00:06:39.604
I will get out of jail.

00:06:40.313 --> 00:06:44.192
And I will meet thousands
of young Russians

00:06:44.233 --> 00:06:49.364
who will tell me that they got
inspired by our fight.

00:06:49.864 --> 00:06:51.824
Over the next ten years,

00:06:51.866 --> 00:06:54.786
Pussy Riot will build
infrastructure, tools

00:06:54.786 --> 00:06:57.872
and network for effective resistance.

00:06:58.915 --> 00:07:01.960
In 2014, we started Mediazona.

00:07:02.335 --> 00:07:06.506
It's unique in Russia, free of censorship,

00:07:06.547 --> 00:07:08.800
[an] independent media outlet.

00:07:09.592 --> 00:07:12.261
In 2022,

00:07:12.261 --> 00:07:17.141
we raised seven million dollars
in two days for Ukraine.

00:07:18.101 --> 00:07:22.939
When reproductive rights became
under attack in the United States,

00:07:22.981 --> 00:07:27.068
we raised close to one million dollars
for Planned Parenthood.

00:07:28.319 --> 00:07:30.321
We started Unicorn DAO

00:07:30.363 --> 00:07:34.742
and raised two million dollars
to collect art made by women

00:07:34.742 --> 00:07:36.577
and non-binary people.

00:07:37.578 --> 00:07:40.623
I really wish I could tell all of this

00:07:40.665 --> 00:07:45.461
to a 22-year-old version of myself

00:07:45.461 --> 00:07:49.257
that is standing behind the bars,

00:07:49.298 --> 00:07:51.342
separated from her family,

00:07:51.384 --> 00:07:55.179
not knowing what's going to happen next.

00:07:57.265 --> 00:07:59.934
Much work remains to be done.

00:08:01.310 --> 00:08:05.273
My friends and family are getting beaten,

00:08:05.314 --> 00:08:07.025
imprisoned,

00:08:07.066 --> 00:08:08.276
poisoned,

00:08:08.276 --> 00:08:11.279
tortured and murdered back home.

00:08:12.572 --> 00:08:14.657
In March 2023,

00:08:14.657 --> 00:08:17.744
I was put on Russia's most-wanted list.

00:08:18.953 --> 00:08:23.374
I'm facing new criminal charges
for the art I made.

00:08:25.126 --> 00:08:26.294
Why?

00:08:26.294 --> 00:08:28.755
Because I said that the emperor is naked

00:08:28.796 --> 00:08:31.174
and because he is, in fact, naked,

00:08:31.215 --> 00:08:32.592
he's scared of it.

00:08:36.387 --> 00:08:42.101
We shattered the world of appearances

00:08:42.101 --> 00:08:48.316
and we said that living a lie
is indeed living a lie.

00:08:48.316 --> 00:08:50.902
And it's dangerous for any dictatorship.

00:08:52.945 --> 00:08:55.406
The reason why I became
a threat to the system,

00:08:55.406 --> 00:09:00.036
not because of any actual
physical power that I have,

00:09:00.078 --> 00:09:02.622
but because courage is contagious.

00:09:03.998 --> 00:09:06.793
And any act of speaking the truth

00:09:06.834 --> 00:09:11.589
can cause incalculable transformations
in social consciousness.

00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:13.966
And we all have this power.

00:09:15.718 --> 00:09:19.597
It's a moral act to use this power.

00:09:20.473 --> 00:09:24.811
You may or may not
achieve the results that you wanted,

00:09:24.811 --> 00:09:27.730
but there is eternal beauty

00:09:27.772 --> 00:09:32.860
in trying to find truth,

00:09:32.860 --> 00:09:37.949
in risking everything you've got
for what's right,

00:09:37.990 --> 00:09:41.577
stop calculating your profit

00:09:41.577 --> 00:09:44.914
and just taking a leap of faith.

00:09:45.998 --> 00:09:50.711
Courage is an ability to act
in the face of fear.

00:09:51.671 --> 00:09:55.758
And some of us

00:09:55.758 --> 00:09:58.010
have chosen to live courageously.

00:09:58.010 --> 00:10:01.013
For some of us, it's not a choice.

00:10:01.013 --> 00:10:03.933
It's a matter of survival,

00:10:03.933 --> 00:10:06.018
like for our Ukrainian friends.

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:12.608
Vladimir Putin became intimidated

00:10:12.608 --> 00:10:16.612
by Ukraine choosing the path
of freedom and democracy.

00:10:17.071 --> 00:10:23.369
That's why the Russian army bombs
maternity wards, schools, hospitals,

00:10:23.411 --> 00:10:27.498
rapes and kills civilians
and throws their bodies in mass graves.

00:10:29.125 --> 00:10:32.170
Putin and everyone who supports him

00:10:32.211 --> 00:10:36.007
are dead inside and they must be defeated.

00:10:37.383 --> 00:10:41.262
And while I'm standing here,

00:10:41.262 --> 00:10:45.391
I want to send a message
to Vladimir Putin directly.

00:10:45.725 --> 00:10:47.810
A wanted criminal to wanted criminal.

00:10:48.311 --> 00:10:51.480
Vladimir Vladimirovich,

00:10:51.522 --> 00:10:54.567
the Kremlin walls
became your prison walls.

00:10:54.567 --> 00:10:56.611
You have already lost.

00:10:56.652 --> 00:10:57.945
You know it.

00:10:58.487 --> 00:11:00.114
That's why you're so afraid.

00:11:00.781 --> 00:11:02.200
You lost in spirit.

00:11:02.575 --> 00:11:06.412
The world is on Ukraine's side.

00:11:06.412 --> 00:11:10.416
The world is with the brave
people of Ukraine.

00:11:12.126 --> 00:11:14.420
And in your final hour,

00:11:14.420 --> 00:11:16.547
when you pray

00:11:16.589 --> 00:11:19.884
to whoever you're going to be praying to,

00:11:19.884 --> 00:11:22.970
know that she is on our side.

00:11:23.012 --> 00:11:24.847
She's on the side of truth.

00:11:26.849 --> 00:11:33.814
(Applause)

00:11:37.235 --> 00:11:40.446
And she's not going to forgive
your crimes against humanity.

00:11:41.781 --> 00:11:45.159
Yesterday, my friend,

00:11:45.201 --> 00:11:48.996
my colleague and comrade
Vladimir Kara-Murza

00:11:49.038 --> 00:11:52.708
was sentenced to 25 years in jail

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:56.796
for publicly condemning the war in Ukraine

00:11:56.837 --> 00:11:58.965
and Vladimir Putin's regime.

00:11:59.632 --> 00:12:03.344
He said in his closing statement,

00:12:03.344 --> 00:12:05.429
"I know that the day will come

00:12:05.471 --> 00:12:09.392
when the darkness engulfing
our country will dissipate.

00:12:09.809 --> 00:12:11.978
This day will come as inevitably

00:12:12.019 --> 00:12:16.148
as spring comes to replace
even the frostiest winter."

00:12:17.608 --> 00:12:21.279
And I'll finish my speech with words

00:12:21.320 --> 00:12:26.325
of ... 22-year-old version of myself.

00:12:28.286 --> 00:12:30.871
I said in my closing statement,

00:12:30.871 --> 00:12:32.081
"Passion,

00:12:32.081 --> 00:12:37.670
openness and naivete
are superior to hypocrisy,

00:12:37.712 --> 00:12:41.841
cunning and contrived decency
that conceals crimes.

00:12:43.384 --> 00:12:44.969
(In Russian) Open all doors,

00:12:45.011 --> 00:12:46.512
take off the epaulettes,

00:12:46.512 --> 00:12:49.390
feel the smell of freedom with us.”

00:12:49.765 --> 00:12:51.225
Thank you.

00:12:51.267 --> 00:12:58.232
(Applause and cheers)

